<name>Korea 1-Tap Map Pack — FREE Seoul 30 · verified 2026-11-28</name>
<description><![CDATA[<b>FREE sampler — 30 of the 109 verified spots, all in Seoul.</b><br>Hours and status re-checked against Google Maps business records on 2026-11-28. Every pin carries the Korean name and a Naver Map link. Curated by a volunteer Google Local Guide contributor · Korea Travel Bible. The full pack (Seoul 66 · Busan 20 · Jeju 23) is 109 pins — see the link in your email.]]></description>
