<Folder><name>1 Eat &amp; Drink</name>
<Placemark><name>광장시장 먹거리 골목 (빈대떡·마약김밥) · Gwangjang Market Netflix Street Food Alley</name><description><![CDATA[<b>#2 Gwangjang Market Netflix Street Food Alley</b><br>광장시장 먹거리 골목 (빈대떡·마약김밥) · Jongno 5-ga<br><br><br><br>Netflix made this alley famous; locals still eat at the stalls facing the north gate. Bindaetteok plus mayak gimbap is the standard order, and cash is faster than card at most stalls.<br><br><a href="https://map.naver.com/p/search/%EA%B4%91%EC%9E%A5%EC%8B%9C%EC%9E%A5">Open in Naver Map (Korean name ready)</a><br><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=37.570039,126.999604">Open in Google Maps</a><br><span style="color:#666;font-size:11px">verified 2026-11-28 · free Seoul 30 sampler</span>]]></description><styleUrl>#pin-food</styleUrl><ExtendedData><Data name="korean_name"><value>광장시장 먹거리 골목 (빈대떡·마약김밥)</value></Data><Data name="layer"><value>1 Eat &amp; Drink</value></Data><Data name="last_verified"><value>2026-11-28</value></Data></ExtendedData><Point><coordinates>126.999604,37.570039,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>을지로 산수갑산 &amp; 골목 삼겹살 · Euljiro Golden Pork Belly Alley</name><description><![CDATA[<b>#1 Euljiro Golden Pork Belly Alley</b><br>을지로 산수갑산 &amp; 골목 삼겹살 · Euljiro Hipjiro<br><br>Hours Mon-Sat 11:30-15:00, 17:00-22:00 · Sun closed · Closed Sun — check before you go<br><br>Traditional BBQ counters often turn away solo diners. Come between 1:30 and 5:00 PM, ask for two portions, and nobody blinks — the alley behind Euljiro&#x27;s printing shops is where office workers eat, not tourists.<br><br><a href="https://map.naver.com/p/search/%EC%9D%84%EC%A7%80%EB%A1%9C%20%EC%82%B0%EC%88%98%EA%B0%91%EC%82%B0">Open in Naver Map (Korean name ready)</a><br><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=37.565419,126.995317">Open in Google Maps</a><br><span style="color:#666;font-size:11px">verified 2026-11-28 · free Seoul 30 sampler</span>]]></description><styleUrl>#pin-food</styleUrl><ExtendedData><Data name="korean_name"><value>을지로 산수갑산 &amp; 골목 삼겹살</value></Data><Data name="layer"><value>1 Eat &amp; Drink</value></Data><Data name="last_verified"><value>2026-11-28</value></Data></ExtendedData><Point><coordinates>126.995317,37.565419,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>을지로 노가리골목 · Euljiro Nogari Alley (Night Beer Tents)</name><description><![CDATA[<b>#37 Euljiro Nogari Alley (Night Beer Tents)</b><br>을지로 노가리골목 · Euljiro<br><br>Price Nogari ₩2,000 · draft beer ₩5,000 · Works after 20:00<br><br>The open-air beer tents run along Eulji-ro 13-gil behind the printing shops, and they fill from about 6 PM. Dried pollack (nogari, ₩2,000) with a ₩5,000 draft is the order; you pay at the counter on the way out, not at the table.<br><br><a href="https://map.naver.com/p/search/%EC%9D%84%EC%A7%80%EB%A1%9C%20%EB%85%B8%EA%B0%80%EB%A6%AC%EA%B3%A8%EB%AA%A9">Open in Naver Map (Korean name ready)</a><br><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=37.567095,126.991895">Open in Google Maps</a><br><span style="color:#666;font-size:11px">verified 2026-11-28 · free Seoul 30 sampler</span>]]></description><styleUrl>#pin-food</styleUrl><ExtendedData><Data name="korean_name"><value>을지로 노가리골목</value></Data><Data name="layer"><value>1 Eat &amp; Drink</value></Data><Data name="last_verified"><value>2026-11-28</value></Data></ExtendedData><Point><coordinates>126.991895,37.567095,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>육회자매집 (광장시장) · Yukhoe Jamaejip (Gwangjang Raw Beef)</name><description><![CDATA[<b>#41 Yukhoe Jamaejip (Gwangjang Raw Beef)</b><br>육회자매집 (광장시장) · Euljiro<br><br>Hours Mon closed · Tue-Sun 09:30-21:20 · Closed Mon — check before you go · Price Yukhoe 200g ₩21,000–23,000 · rice bowl ₩10,000 · Rain-proof<br><br>The start of the raw-beef row inside Gwangjang Market. 200 g of yukhoe is ₩21,000–23,000 and a yukhoe rice bowl ₩10,000–11,000; order on the tablet, and come before 12:00 or after 14:00 to skip the lunch queue.<br><br><a href="https://map.naver.com/p/search/%EC%9C%A1%ED%9A%8C%EC%9E%90%EB%A7%A4%EC%A7%91%20%28%EA%B4%91%EC%9E%A5%EC%8B%9C%EC%9E%A5%29">Open in Naver Map (Korean name ready)</a><br><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=37.570536,126.999870">Open in Google Maps</a><br><span style="color:#666;font-size:11px">verified 2026-11-28 · free Seoul 30 sampler</span>]]></description><styleUrl>#pin-food</styleUrl><ExtendedData><Data name="korean_name"><value>육회자매집 (광장시장)</value></Data><Data name="layer"><value>1 Eat &amp; Drink</value></Data><Data name="last_verified"><value>2026-11-28</value></Data></ExtendedData><Point><coordinates>126.99987,37.570536,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>통인시장 · Tongin Market (Coin Lunchbox)</name><description><![CDATA[<b>#62 Tongin Market (Coin Lunchbox)</b><br>통인시장 · Seochon<br><br>Hours Daily 07:00-21:00 · Price Coin ₩500 (10 for ₩5,000) · lunchbox ₩10,000 typical · Rain-proof<br><br>Buy brass coins at the lunchbox café (₩500 each, ten for ₩5,000), then trade them at the marked stalls and eat what you gathered. Coins are sold until 15:00 weekdays / 16:00 weekends; closed Tuesdays.<br><br><a href="https://map.naver.com/p/search/%ED%86%B5%EC%9D%B8%EC%8B%9C%EC%9E%A5">Open in Naver Map (Korean name ready)</a><br><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=37.580765,126.970676">Open in Google Maps</a><br><span style="color:#666;font-size:11px">verified 2026-11-28 · free Seoul 30 sampler</span>]]></description><styleUrl>#pin-market</styleUrl><ExtendedData><Data name="korean_name"><value>통인시장</value></Data><Data name="layer"><value>1 Eat &amp; Drink</value></Data><Data name="last_verified"><value>2026-11-28</value></Data></ExtendedData><Point><coordinates>126.970676,37.580765,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>토속촌 삼계탕 · Tosokchon Samgyetang</name><description><![CDATA[<b>#64 Tosokchon Samgyetang</b><br>토속촌 삼계탕 · Gwanghwamun<br><br>Hours Daily 10:00-22:00 · Price Samgyetang ₩20,000 · ogolgye ₩25,000 · Rain-proof<br><br>Ginseng chicken since 1983, a hanok block west of Gyeongbokgung: ₩20,000 for the standard pot, ₩25,000 for black-silkie. A glass of ginseng liquor arrives with it; open 10:00–22:00 daily, queue at 12:00 and 18:30.<br><br><a href="https://map.naver.com/p/search/%ED%86%A0%EC%86%8D%EC%B4%8C%20%EC%82%BC%EA%B3%84%ED%83%95">Open in Naver Map (Korean name ready)</a><br><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=37.577779,126.971591">Open in Google Maps</a><br><span style="color:#666;font-size:11px">verified 2026-11-28 · free Seoul 30 sampler</span>]]></description><styleUrl>#pin-food</styleUrl><ExtendedData><Data name="korean_name"><value>토속촌 삼계탕</value></Data><Data name="layer"><value>1 Eat &amp; Drink</value></Data><Data name="last_verified"><value>2026-11-28</value></Data></ExtendedData><Point><coordinates>126.971591,37.577779,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>명동교자 본점 (미쉐린 빕구르망) · Myeongdong Kyoja (Handmade Kalguksu &amp; Dumplings)</name><description><![CDATA[<b>#4 Myeongdong Kyoja (Handmade Kalguksu &amp; Dumplings)</b><br>명동교자 본점 (미쉐린 빕구르망) · Myeongdong Main<br><br>Hours Daily 10:30-21:00<br><br>Michelin Bib Gourmand kalguksu since 1966. Order kalguksu plus a plate of dumplings, pay at the counter, and avoid 12–1 PM when the queue runs down the block.<br><br><a href="https://map.naver.com/p/search/%EB%AA%85%EB%8F%99%EA%B5%90%EC%9E%90">Open in Naver Map (Korean name ready)</a><br><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=37.561015,126.986083">Open in Google Maps</a><br><span style="color:#666;font-size:11px">verified 2026-11-28 · free Seoul 30 sampler</span>]]></description><styleUrl>#pin-food</styleUrl><ExtendedData><Data name="korean_name"><value>명동교자 본점 (미쉐린 빕구르망)</value></Data><Data name="layer"><value>1 Eat &amp; Drink</value></Data><Data name="last_verified"><value>2026-11-28</value></Data></ExtendedData><Point><coordinates>126.986083,37.561015,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>미성옥 · Miseong-og (Beef Bone Soup, Myeongdong)</name><description><![CDATA[<b>#44 Miseong-og (Beef Bone Soup, Myeongdong)</b><br>미성옥 · Myeongdong<br><br>Hours Daily 06:00-21:00 · Price Seolleongtang ₩12,000 · suyuk ₩35,000 (small) · Rain-proof<br><br>Two things on the menu: seolleongtang ₩12,000 (large ₩14,000) and boiled beef ₩35,000–45,000. It opens at 06:00, which makes it the breakfast spot after a dawn flight, and the kkakdugi is the reason people come back.<br><br><a href="https://map.naver.com/p/search/%EB%AF%B8%EC%84%B1%EC%98%A5">Open in Naver Map (Korean name ready)</a><br><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=37.564124,126.983912">Open in Google Maps</a><br><span style="color:#666;font-size:11px">verified 2026-11-28 · free Seoul 30 sampler</span>]]></description><styleUrl>#pin-food</styleUrl><ExtendedData><Data name="korean_name"><value>미성옥</value></Data><Data name="layer"><value>1 Eat &amp; Drink</value></Data><Data name="last_verified"><value>2026-11-28</value></Data></ExtendedData><Point><coordinates>126.983912,37.564124,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>소문난 성수 감자탕 · Somunnan Seongsu Gamjatang (24h Pork Bone Soup)</name><description><![CDATA[<b>#46 Somunnan Seongsu Gamjatang (24h Pork Bone Soup)</b><br>소문난 성수 감자탕 · Seongsu<br><br>Hours Open 24h · Price Gamja-guk meal ₩12,000 · small pot ₩32,000 · Works after 20:00 · Rain-proof<br><br>Open 24 hours, so it covers a 2 AM arrival: the one-person gamja-guk rice meal is ₩12,000 (cabbage version ₩13,000) and a small pot for two is ₩32,000. Lunch is the queue; the annex on Yeonmujang 7-gil takes the overflow.<br><br><a href="https://map.naver.com/p/search/%EC%86%8C%EB%AC%B8%EB%82%9C%20%EC%84%B1%EC%88%98%20%EA%B0%90%EC%9E%90%ED%83%95">Open in Naver Map (Korean name ready)</a><br><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=37.542824,127.054373">Open in Google Maps</a><br><span style="color:#666;font-size:11px">verified 2026-11-28 · free Seoul 30 sampler</span>]]></description><styleUrl>#pin-food</styleUrl><ExtendedData><Data name="korean_name"><value>소문난 성수 감자탕</value></Data><Data name="layer"><value>1 Eat &amp; Drink</value></Data><Data name="last_verified"><value>2026-11-28</value></Data></ExtendedData><Point><coordinates>127.054373,37.542824,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>진주집 · Jinju-jip (Kongguksu in a Basement)</name><description><![CDATA[<b>#53 Jinju-jip (Kongguksu in a Basement)</b><br>진주집 · Yeouido<br><br>Hours Mon-Fri 10:00-20:00 · Sat 10:00-19:00 · Sun closed · Closed Sun — check before you go · Price Kongguksu ₩15,000 · bibim guksu ₩12,000 · Rain-proof<br><br>Office workers&#x27; noodle canteen in the basement of the Manhattan building: cold soybean noodles ₩15,000, bibim noodles ₩12,000, a plate of dumplings ₩12,000. Closed Sunday; Friday closes at 19:00.<br><br><a href="https://map.naver.com/p/search/%EC%A7%84%EC%A3%BC%EC%A7%91">Open in Naver Map (Korean name ready)</a><br><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=37.520723,126.927035">Open in Google Maps</a><br><span style="color:#666;font-size:11px">verified 2026-11-28 · free Seoul 30 sampler</span>]]></description><styleUrl>#pin-food</styleUrl><ExtendedData><Data name="korean_name"><value>진주집</value></Data><Data name="layer"><value>1 Eat &amp; Drink</value></Data><Data name="last_verified"><value>2026-11-28</value></Data></ExtendedData><Point><coordinates>126.927035,37.520723,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>망원시장 · Mangwon Market (Kalguksu &amp; Hongeo)</name><description><![CDATA[<b>#71 Mangwon Market (Kalguksu &amp; Hongeo)</b><br>망원시장 · Mangwon<br><br>Hours Daily 09:00-21:00 · Rain-proof<br><br>A neighbourhood market that never became a tourist one: knife-cut noodles, hongeo (fermented skate) and fried chicken sold by weight. 09:00–21:00, cash still faster at the older stalls.<br><br><a href="https://map.naver.com/p/search/%EB%A7%9D%EC%9B%90%EC%8B%9C%EC%9E%A5">Open in Naver Map (Korean name ready)</a><br><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=37.555902,126.906285">Open in Google Maps</a><br><span style="color:#666;font-size:11px">verified 2026-11-28 · free Seoul 30 sampler</span>]]></description><styleUrl>#pin-market</styleUrl><ExtendedData><Data name="korean_name"><value>망원시장</value></Data><Data name="layer"><value>1 Eat &amp; Drink</value></Data><Data name="last_verified"><value>2026-11-28</value></Data></ExtendedData><Point><coordinates>126.906285,37.555902,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
</Folder>
<Folder><name>2 Cafes</name>
<Placemark><name>커피한약방 · Coffee Hanyakbang (Old Pharmacy Cafe)</name><description><![CDATA[<b>#40 Coffee Hanyakbang (Old Pharmacy Cafe)</b><br>커피한약방 · Euljiro<br><br>Hours Mon-Fri 10:00-22:00 · Sat 11:00-22:00 · Sun 11:00-20:00 · Price Filter coffee ~₩5,800 · latte ₩5,500 · Rain-proof<br><br>An old herbal pharmacy kept almost intact down a dead-end alley off Samil-daero 12-gil. There is no espresso machine — it is all hand-poured filter (from about ₩5,500–6,000), and overspill seating is in the sister room across the lane.<br><br><a href="https://map.naver.com/p/search/%EC%BB%A4%ED%94%BC%ED%95%9C%EC%95%BD%EB%B0%A9">Open in Naver Map (Korean name ready)</a><br><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=37.566530,126.988594">Open in Google Maps</a><br><span style="color:#666;font-size:11px">verified 2026-11-28 · free Seoul 30 sampler</span>]]></description><styleUrl>#pin-cafe</styleUrl><ExtendedData><Data name="korean_name"><value>커피한약방</value></Data><Data name="layer"><value>2 Cafes</value></Data><Data name="last_verified"><value>2026-11-28</value></Data></ExtendedData><Point><coordinates>126.988594,37.56653,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>익선동 한옥거리 · Ikseondong Hanok Alley</name><description><![CDATA[<b>#6 Ikseondong Hanok Alley</b><br>익선동 한옥거리 · Jongno / Ikseon<br><br><br><br>Tiny hanok houses converted into bars and coffee rooms. Come after 5 PM when the courtyards light up; most rooms seat under 20 people, so a 15-minute wait is normal.<br><br><a href="https://map.naver.com/p/search/%EC%9D%B5%EC%84%A0%EB%8F%99%20%ED%95%9C%EC%98%A5%EA%B1%B0%EB%A6%AC">Open in Naver Map (Korean name ready)</a><br><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=37.572930,126.989595">Open in Google Maps</a><br><span style="color:#666;font-size:11px">verified 2026-11-28 · free Seoul 30 sampler</span>]]></description><styleUrl>#pin-cafe</styleUrl><ExtendedData><Data name="korean_name"><value>익선동 한옥거리</value></Data><Data name="layer"><value>2 Cafes</value></Data><Data name="last_verified"><value>2026-11-28</value></Data></ExtendedData><Point><coordinates>126.989595,37.57293,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>대오서점 · Daeo Bookstore (Seochon)</name><description><![CDATA[<b>#63 Daeo Bookstore (Seochon)</b><br>대오서점 · Seochon<br><br>Hours Daily 12:00-20:00 · Rain-proof<br><br>A 1951 second-hand bookshop kept as a reading room: entry is free and you pay only for the drink, 12:00–20:00 daily. Shoes come off at the step, and silence is the house rule.<br><br><a href="https://map.naver.com/p/search/%EB%8C%80%EC%98%A4%EC%84%9C%EC%A0%90">Open in Naver Map (Korean name ready)</a><br><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=37.579734,126.969326">Open in Google Maps</a><br><span style="color:#666;font-size:11px">verified 2026-11-28 · free Seoul 30 sampler</span>]]></description><styleUrl>#pin-cafe</styleUrl><ExtendedData><Data name="korean_name"><value>대오서점</value></Data><Data name="layer"><value>2 Cafes</value></Data><Data name="last_verified"><value>2026-11-28</value></Data></ExtendedData><Point><coordinates>126.969326,37.579734,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>어니언 성수 · Onion Seongsu (Warehouse Bakery)</name><description><![CDATA[<b>#45 Onion Seongsu (Warehouse Bakery)</b><br>어니언 성수 · Seongsu<br><br>Hours Mon-Fri 08:00-22:00 · Sat-Sun 09:00-22:00 · Price Americano ₩5,500 · pandoro ₩6,000 · Rain-proof<br><br>A 1970s factory turned bakery-cafe: pick bread on the tray first, then order drinks at the counter, then find a seat upstairs. Americano ₩5,500; pandoro and ang-butter are the two things to take.<br><br><a href="https://map.naver.com/p/search/%EC%96%B4%EB%8B%88%EC%96%B8%20%EC%84%B1%EC%88%98">Open in Naver Map (Korean name ready)</a><br><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=37.544733,127.058209">Open in Google Maps</a><br><span style="color:#666;font-size:11px">verified 2026-11-28 · free Seoul 30 sampler</span>]]></description><styleUrl>#pin-cafe</styleUrl><ExtendedData><Data name="korean_name"><value>어니언 성수</value></Data><Data name="layer"><value>2 Cafes</value></Data><Data name="last_verified"><value>2026-11-28</value></Data></ExtendedData><Point><coordinates>127.058209,37.544733,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>안트러사이트 서교 · Anthracite Coffee Seogyo (Former Sock Factory)</name><description><![CDATA[<b>#73 Anthracite Coffee Seogyo (Former Sock Factory)</b><br>안트러사이트 서교 · Seogyo<br><br>Hours Daily 09:00-22:00 · Rain-proof<br><br>A roastery inside a 1970s sock factory: concrete, machinery, and a long counter where they pour single origins. 09:00–22:00 daily; the upstairs floor is the quiet one.<br><br><a href="https://map.naver.com/p/search/%EC%95%88%ED%8A%B8%EB%9F%AC%EC%82%AC%EC%9D%B4%ED%8A%B8%20%EC%84%9C%EA%B5%90">Open in Naver Map (Korean name ready)</a><br><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=37.555433,126.911701">Open in Google Maps</a><br><span style="color:#666;font-size:11px">verified 2026-11-28 · free Seoul 30 sampler</span>]]></description><styleUrl>#pin-cafe</styleUrl><ExtendedData><Data name="korean_name"><value>안트러사이트 서교</value></Data><Data name="layer"><value>2 Cafes</value></Data><Data name="last_verified"><value>2026-11-28</value></Data></ExtendedData><Point><coordinates>126.911701,37.555433,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>코엑스몰 별마당 도서관 · Starfield Library (Coex Mall)</name><description><![CDATA[<b>#8 Starfield Library (Coex Mall)</b><br>코엑스몰 별마당 도서관 · Samseong Gangnam<br><br>Hours Daily 10:30-22:00<br><br>The 13-metre bookshelf in Coex Mall is free and open until 10 PM. Morning light is flat; 7–9 PM with the escalator empty is the shot.<br><br><a href="https://map.naver.com/p/search/%EB%B3%84%EB%A7%88%EB%8B%B9%EB%8F%84%EC%84%9C%EA%B4%80">Open in Naver Map (Korean name ready)</a><br><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=37.510213,127.060019">Open in Google Maps</a><br><span style="color:#666;font-size:11px">verified 2026-11-28 · free Seoul 30 sampler</span>]]></description><styleUrl>#pin-cafe</styleUrl><ExtendedData><Data name="korean_name"><value>코엑스몰 별마당 도서관</value></Data><Data name="layer"><value>2 Cafes</value></Data><Data name="last_verified"><value>2026-11-28</value></Data></ExtendedData><Point><coordinates>127.060019,37.510213,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
</Folder>
<Folder><name>3 Sights &amp; Views</name>
<Placemark><name>청계천 · Cheonggyecheon Stream Walk</name><description><![CDATA[<b>#43 Cheonggyecheon Stream Walk</b><br>청계천 · Euljiro<br><br>Hours Open 24h · Works after 20:00<br><br>A 5.8 km sunken stream path from Gwanghwamun to Dongdaemun, 5 m below the traffic and open all night. Stairs down at every bridge; the lit stretch near Jongno is the calmest after 21:00.<br><br><a href="https://map.naver.com/p/search/%EC%B2%AD%EA%B3%84%EC%B2%9C">Open in Naver Map (Korean name ready)</a><br><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=37.569101,126.978669">Open in Google Maps</a><br><span style="color:#666;font-size:11px">verified 2026-11-28 · free Seoul 30 sampler</span>]]></description><styleUrl>#pin-culture</styleUrl><ExtendedData><Data name="korean_name"><value>청계천</value></Data><Data name="layer"><value>3 Sights &amp; Views</value></Data><Data name="last_verified"><value>2026-11-28</value></Data></ExtendedData><Point><coordinates>126.978669,37.569101,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>북촌한옥마을 · Bukchon Hanok Village</name><description><![CDATA[<b>#12 Bukchon Hanok Village</b><br>북촌한옥마을 · Jongno / Bukchon<br><br>Hours Daily 10:00-17:00<br><br>A residential neighbourhood, not a theme park: keep your voice down and skip the 10 AM–4 PM window when tour buses unload. The best alleys are the ones sloping down toward Samcheong-dong.<br><br><a href="https://map.naver.com/p/search/%EB%B6%81%EC%B4%8C%ED%95%9C%EC%98%A5%EB%A7%88%EC%9D%84">Open in Naver Map (Korean name ready)</a><br><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=37.581470,126.984952">Open in Google Maps</a><br><span style="color:#666;font-size:11px">verified 2026-11-28 · free Seoul 30 sampler</span>]]></description><styleUrl>#pin-culture</styleUrl><ExtendedData><Data name="korean_name"><value>북촌한옥마을</value></Data><Data name="layer"><value>3 Sights &amp; Views</value></Data><Data name="last_verified"><value>2026-11-28</value></Data></ExtendedData><Point><coordinates>126.984952,37.58147,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>경복궁 &amp; 한복 무료입장 · Gyeongbokgung Palace (Free Hanbok Entry)</name><description><![CDATA[<b>#14 Gyeongbokgung Palace (Free Hanbok Entry)</b><br>경복궁 &amp; 한복 무료입장 · Jongno Bukchon<br><br>Hours Mon, Wed-Sun 09:00-17:00 · Tue closed · Closed Tue — check before you go<br><br>Hanbok rental inside the palace district gets you free entry (worth ₩3,000) — the gate staff simply wave you through. Last entry is one hour before closing, and it is closed on Tuesdays.<br><br><a href="https://map.naver.com/p/search/%EA%B2%BD%EB%B3%B5%EA%B6%81">Open in Naver Map (Korean name ready)</a><br><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=37.579617,126.977041">Open in Google Maps</a><br><span style="color:#666;font-size:11px">verified 2026-11-28 · free Seoul 30 sampler</span>]]></description><styleUrl>#pin-culture</styleUrl><ExtendedData><Data name="korean_name"><value>경복궁 &amp; 한복 무료입장</value></Data><Data name="layer"><value>3 Sights &amp; Views</value></Data><Data name="last_verified"><value>2026-11-28</value></Data></ExtendedData><Point><coordinates>126.977041,37.579617,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>종묘 · Jongmyo Royal Shrine</name><description><![CDATA[<b>#67 Jongmyo Royal Shrine</b><br>종묘 · Jongno<br><br>Hours Mon, Wed-Fri 09:20-17:40 · Tue closed · Sat-Sun 09:00-18:30 · Closed Tue — check before you go · Price Adult ₩1,000 (under 25 and over 65 free)<br><br>The Confucian shrine behind Changdeokgung — ₩1,000, closed Tuesdays. On Mondays, Thursdays and Fridays you can only enter with the timed guided tour (English at 10:00, 12:00, 14:00 and 16:00, about 50 minutes, capped at 200 people); weekends you walk freely. The 101 m stone courtyard is the reason to come.<br><br><a href="https://map.naver.com/p/search/%EC%A2%85%EB%AC%98">Open in Naver Map (Korean name ready)</a><br><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=37.574631,126.993816">Open in Google Maps</a><br><span style="color:#666;font-size:11px">verified 2026-11-28 · free Seoul 30 sampler</span>]]></description><styleUrl>#pin-culture</styleUrl><ExtendedData><Data name="korean_name"><value>종묘</value></Data><Data name="layer"><value>3 Sights &amp; Views</value></Data><Data name="last_verified"><value>2026-11-28</value></Data></ExtendedData><Point><coordinates>126.993816,37.574631,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>서울숲 · Seoul Forest Park</name><description><![CDATA[<b>#48 Seoul Forest Park</b><br>서울숲 · Seongsu<br><br>Hours Open 24h<br><br>A large park on the old Ttukseom racetrack, free and open all night; the deer enclosure and the wetland boardwalk are the two detours worth taking. Weekday mornings are empty.<br><br><a href="https://map.naver.com/p/search/%EC%84%9C%EC%9A%B8%EC%88%B2">Open in Naver Map (Korean name ready)</a><br><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=37.544388,127.037442">Open in Google Maps</a><br><span style="color:#666;font-size:11px">verified 2026-11-28 · free Seoul 30 sampler</span>]]></description><styleUrl>#pin-culture</styleUrl><ExtendedData><Data name="korean_name"><value>서울숲</value></Data><Data name="layer"><value>3 Sights &amp; Views</value></Data><Data name="last_verified"><value>2026-11-28</value></Data></ExtendedData><Point><coordinates>127.037442,37.544388,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>뚝섬한강공원 · Ttukseom Hangang Park</name><description><![CDATA[<b>#50 Ttukseom Hangang Park</b><br>뚝섬한강공원 · Seongsu<br><br>Hours Open 24h · Works after 20:00<br><br>The Han River park with the instant-ramyeon machines and the widest sunset view; buy noodles at the kiosk, add an egg, and sit on the steps facing the water. Open 24 hours, no entry fee.<br><br><a href="https://map.naver.com/p/search/%EB%9A%9D%EC%84%AC%ED%95%9C%EA%B0%95%EA%B3%B5%EC%9B%90">Open in Naver Map (Korean name ready)</a><br><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=37.529351,127.069956">Open in Google Maps</a><br><span style="color:#666;font-size:11px">verified 2026-11-28 · free Seoul 30 sampler</span>]]></description><styleUrl>#pin-culture</styleUrl><ExtendedData><Data name="korean_name"><value>뚝섬한강공원</value></Data><Data name="layer"><value>3 Sights &amp; Views</value></Data><Data name="last_verified"><value>2026-11-28</value></Data></ExtendedData><Point><coordinates>127.069956,37.529351,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>더현대 서울 사운즈 포레스트 (퀸즈백화점) · The Hyundai Seoul: Sounds Forest (5F)</name><description><![CDATA[<b>#17 The Hyundai Seoul: Sounds Forest (5F)</b><br>더현대 서울 사운즈 포레스트 (퀸즈백화점) · Yeouido<br><br><br><br>The Hyundai Seoul&#x27;s indoor forest on the 5th floor — the &#x27;Queen of Tears&#x27; department-store scene. Weekday mornings are empty; weekends are a photo queue.<br><br><a href="https://map.naver.com/p/search/%EB%8D%94%ED%98%84%EB%8C%80%20%EC%84%9C%EC%9A%B8">Open in Naver Map (Korean name ready)</a><br><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=37.526050,126.928296">Open in Google Maps</a><br><span style="color:#666;font-size:11px">verified 2026-11-28 · free Seoul 30 sampler</span>]]></description><styleUrl>#pin-culture</styleUrl><ExtendedData><Data name="korean_name"><value>더현대 서울 사운즈 포레스트 (퀸즈백화점)</value></Data><Data name="layer"><value>3 Sights &amp; Views</value></Data><Data name="last_verified"><value>2026-11-28</value></Data></ExtendedData><Point><coordinates>126.928296,37.52605,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>경의선숲길 · Gyeongui Line Forest Park (Yeonnam)</name><description><![CDATA[<b>#70 Gyeongui Line Forest Park (Yeonnam)</b><br>경의선숲길 · Yeonnam<br><br>Hours Open 24h · Works after 20:00<br><br>The old railway line turned into a 6 km park; the Yeonnam stretch is where the cafés open onto the grass. Open 24 hours and free — walk it from Hongik Univ. Station toward Yeonnam-dong.<br><br><a href="https://map.naver.com/p/search/%EA%B2%BD%EC%9D%98%EC%84%A0%EC%88%B2%EA%B8%B8">Open in Naver Map (Korean name ready)</a><br><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=37.566207,126.919236">Open in Google Maps</a><br><span style="color:#666;font-size:11px">verified 2026-11-28 · free Seoul 30 sampler</span>]]></description><styleUrl>#pin-culture</styleUrl><ExtendedData><Data name="korean_name"><value>경의선숲길</value></Data><Data name="layer"><value>3 Sights &amp; Views</value></Data><Data name="last_verified"><value>2026-11-28</value></Data></ExtendedData><Point><coordinates>126.919236,37.566207,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>논현동 유정식당 (방탄 성지) · Yoojung Sikdang (BTS Trainee Diner)</name><description><![CDATA[<b>#19 Yoojung Sikdang (BTS Trainee Diner)</b><br>논현동 유정식당 (방탄 성지) · Nonhyeon Gangnam<br><br>Hours Mon-Fri 10:00-21:30 · Sat-Sun 10:00-20:00<br><br>The old BTS trainee diner in Nonhyeon: black-pork bibimbap, cash-friendly, and a queue at lunch. Go after 2 PM and the same table is free in ten minutes.<br><br><a href="https://map.naver.com/p/search/%EC%9C%A0%EC%A0%95%EC%8B%9D%EB%8B%B9">Open in Naver Map (Korean name ready)</a><br><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=37.518388,127.028077">Open in Google Maps</a><br><span style="color:#666;font-size:11px">verified 2026-11-28 · free Seoul 30 sampler</span>]]></description><styleUrl>#pin-kpop</styleUrl><ExtendedData><Data name="korean_name"><value>논현동 유정식당 (방탄 성지)</value></Data><Data name="layer"><value>3 Sights &amp; Views</value></Data><Data name="last_verified"><value>2026-11-28</value></Data></ExtendedData><Point><coordinates>127.028077,37.518388,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>낙산공원 한양도성 성곽길 · Naksan Park Fortress Wall (케데헌 8경 #1)</name><description><![CDATA[<b>#18 Naksan Park Fortress Wall (케데헌 8경 #1)</b><br>낙산공원 한양도성 성곽길 · Daehangno / Naksan<br><br>Hours Open 24h<br><br>Drama fans come for the fortress-wall shot from &#x27;Queen of Tears&#x27; — walk up from Daehangno, and go 40 minutes before sunset so the wall is lit, not silhouetted.<br><br><a href="https://map.naver.com/p/search/%EB%82%99%EC%82%B0%EA%B3%B5%EC%9B%90">Open in Naver Map (Korean name ready)</a><br><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=37.580657,127.007484">Open in Google Maps</a><br><span style="color:#666;font-size:11px">verified 2026-11-28 · free Seoul 30 sampler</span>]]></description><styleUrl>#pin-kpop</styleUrl><ExtendedData><Data name="korean_name"><value>낙산공원 한양도성 성곽길</value></Data><Data name="layer"><value>3 Sights &amp; Views</value></Data><Data name="last_verified"><value>2026-11-28</value></Data></ExtendedData><Point><coordinates>127.007484,37.580657,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
</Folder>
<Folder><name>4 Indoor &amp; Transit</name>
<Placemark><name>국립중앙박물관 · National Museum of Korea (Free)</name><description><![CDATA[<b>#66 National Museum of Korea (Free)</b><br>국립중앙박물관 · Yongsan<br><br>Hours Mon-Tue, Thu-Fri, Sun 09:30-17:30 · Wed, Sat 09:30-21:00 · Rain-proof<br><br>Free, and big enough to sit out a whole rainy day: 09:30–17:30, with late closing at 21:00 on Wednesdays and Saturdays. Leave bags in the free lockers by the main hall.<br><br><a href="https://map.naver.com/p/search/%EA%B5%AD%EB%A6%BD%EC%A4%91%EC%95%99%EB%B0%95%EB%AC%BC%EA%B4%80">Open in Naver Map (Korean name ready)</a><br><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=37.523851,126.980470">Open in Google Maps</a><br><span style="color:#666;font-size:11px">verified 2026-11-28 · free Seoul 30 sampler</span>]]></description><styleUrl>#pin-indoor</styleUrl><ExtendedData><Data name="korean_name"><value>국립중앙박물관</value></Data><Data name="layer"><value>4 Indoor &amp; Transit</value></Data><Data name="last_verified"><value>2026-11-28</value></Data></ExtendedData><Point><coordinates>126.98047,37.523851,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>롯데월드타워 서울스카이 · Seoul Sky (Lotte World Tower 118F)</name><description><![CDATA[<b>#79 Seoul Sky (Lotte World Tower 118F)</b><br>롯데월드타워 서울스카이 · Jamsil<br><br>Hours Mon-Thu 10:30-22:00 · Fri-Sun 10:30-23:00 · Works after 20:00 · Rain-proof<br><br>The 118th-floor deck: 10:30–22:00 Sunday–Thursday, to 23:00 Friday–Saturday. Go 40 minutes before sunset so you get the daylight and the city lights on one ticket; buy the timed slot online to skip the lobby queue.<br><br><a href="https://map.naver.com/p/search/%EB%A1%AF%EB%8D%B0%EC%9B%94%EB%93%9C%ED%83%80%EC%9B%8C%20%EC%84%9C%EC%9A%B8%EC%8A%A4%EC%B9%B4%EC%9D%B4">Open in Naver Map (Korean name ready)</a><br><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=37.512529,127.102305">Open in Google Maps</a><br><span style="color:#666;font-size:11px">verified 2026-11-28 · free Seoul 30 sampler</span>]]></description><styleUrl>#pin-indoor</styleUrl><ExtendedData><Data name="korean_name"><value>롯데월드타워 서울스카이</value></Data><Data name="layer"><value>4 Indoor &amp; Transit</value></Data><Data name="last_verified"><value>2026-11-28</value></Data></ExtendedData><Point><coordinates>127.102305,37.512529,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>서울역 물품보관함 · Seoul Station Lockers (Subway Level B1)</name><description><![CDATA[<b>#21 Seoul Station Lockers (Subway Level B1)</b><br>서울역 물품보관함 · Jung / Seoul Station<br><br><br><br>Card-operated lockers on the subway level, sized small to large, charged by the hour. They fill by mid-morning on weekends — the KTX side has a second bank near exit 15.<br><br><a href="https://map.naver.com/p/search/%EC%84%9C%EC%9A%B8%EC%97%AD%20%EB%AC%BC%ED%92%88%EB%B3%B4%EA%B4%80%ED%95%A8">Open in Naver Map (Korean name ready)</a><br><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=37.555946,126.972317">Open in Google Maps</a><br><span style="color:#666;font-size:11px">verified 2026-11-28 · free Seoul 30 sampler</span>]]></description><styleUrl>#pin-transit</styleUrl><ExtendedData><Data name="korean_name"><value>서울역 물품보관함</value></Data><Data name="layer"><value>4 Indoor &amp; Transit</value></Data><Data name="last_verified"><value>2026-11-28</value></Data></ExtendedData><Point><coordinates>126.972317,37.555946,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
</Folder>
